flowchart LR
    subgraph AppRepo["app-repo"]
        Dev[Developer] -->|push| Branch[Feature Branch]
        Branch -->|PR| PR[Pull Request to main]
        PR --> Tests[CI: Tests]
        Tests -->|merge| Main[main]
        Main --> Build[Build Docker Image]
    end

    subgraph Registry["Amazon ECR"]
        ECR[(image:SHA)]
    end

    subgraph HelmRepo["helm-repo"]
        Helm[values.yaml tag update]
    end

    subgraph InfraRepo["infra-repo"]
        TF[Terraform: EKS]
    end

    subgraph Cluster["EKS Cluster"]
        Argo[ArgoCD]
        Pods[MartialGame Pods]
    end

    Build -->|push| ECR
    Build -->|bump tag| Helm
    Helm -->|watched| Argo
    TF -->|provisions| Cluster
    Argo -->|sync| Pods
    ECR -->|pull| Pods